cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Multi-hazard risk assessment of the Marmara basin: figure-generation and analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Documented Python pipeline for a geospatial multi-hazard (earthquake,
  tsunami, strong wind) risk assessment of the Marmara Sea basin and Istanbul.
  Produces the publication figures from open geospatial datasets.
